Third-party components
================================================================================

The lab builds on unmodified third-party open-source components pulled at
image build time (nginx, Apache httpd, Varnish, CoreDNS, LocalStack, Keycloak,
MySQL, PostgreSQL, Microsoft SQL Server, MongoDB, OpenLDAP, Dovecot, Mailpit,
Flask, Django, Express, Playwright/Chromium, and others). Each remains under
its own upstream license. Nothing here is a derivative of those projects'
source; they are consumed as published container images or packages.

Microsoft SQL Server is used under the Microsoft SQL Server EULA for
development/evaluation purposes (`ACCEPT_EULA=Y`). It is not redistributed
in this repository — only referenced by image tag.

