================================================================================
Intentionally vulnerable software
================================================================================

This repository deliberately contains insecure code, weak cryptography,
hardcoded synthetic credentials and exploitable endpoints. It exists solely
for authorised security testing, education and training. See SECURITY.md.

All credentials, personal data, tokens and keys appearing in this repository
are SYNTHETIC and were generated for the lab. They are not real secrets.